  "releaseNotes": "BugFixes:\n1.) Disposing CodecContext does not throw an NullReferenceExcepion anymore.\n2.) Accessing disposed CodecContext's properties return default values instead of throwing a NullReferenceException\n3.) vcodec_get_supported_config does not return the length but 0 if no error. The length is provided by an output parameter.",
